    // Authorization truth lives in `user_roles`: a stale session role must never outlive a
    // demotion. `disableCookieCache` only bypasses the cookie cache, it does not refresh the
    // role embedded in the session payload, so always consult the database here (or have the
    // authenticator strip the role when it is revoked).
    const roles = await roleRepository.rolesForUser(session.user.id);
```

2. 【高/易被误用的授权设计】requireAdmin 返回 Response | undefined，调用方必须显式 `const res = requireAdmin(ctx); if (res) return res;`。任何一处遗漏（lint 未拦截、code review 疏忽）都会静默通过管理员校验——授权检查失败模式应为 fail-closed。建议改为中间件 `requireAdmin: MiddlewareHandler` 并在路由上 `app.use('/admin/*', requireAdmin())`，或返回 boolean 语义更明确的形式。
